INPUT DATA:
- Food data: 18588 samples, 23 total features
- Filtered data: 18271 samples, 302 total features
- Thesaurus: 25671 ingredient mappings
- Ingredient-nutrient data: 133 ingredients, 8 nutrients

PROCESSING RESULTS:
- Top k ingredients selected for feature engineering
