NUTPRED COMPLETE PIPELINE EXECUTION SUMMARY
================================================

EXECUTION DETAILS:
- Start time: 2025-09-10 15:48:01
- Output directory: complete_outputs
None- Filter type: ingredients
- Filter values: ['popcorn', 'pretzel', 'pretzels']

INPUT DATA:
- Food data: 18588 samples, 23 total features
- Filtered data: 18271 samples, 302 total features
- Thesaurus: 25671 ingredient mappings
- Ingredient-nutrient data: 133 ingredients, 8 nutrients

PROCESSING RESULTS:
- Top k ingredients selected for feature engineering
- 116 binary features created
- 133 score features created  
- 10 UMAP features used
- 23 base nutrients predicted
- 3 target nutrients predicted

MODEL PERFORMANCE:
- Optimization solver: OSQP with nnls_mono constraint
- ML models trained: 24 different feature combinations (evaluated on strict and all samples)
- Total model evaluations: 145 (including cross-validation and filter breakdowns)

OUTPUT FILES GENERATED:
1. df_with_preds_all_models.csv - Complete dataset with all predictions
2. ingredient_parsing_.csv - Ingredient parsing and mapping results
3. metrics_all_models.csv - Performance metrics for all models
4. ingredient_weights__full.csv - Optimization weights for each sample

5. plots/ - Directory containing comprehensive visualizations:
   - metrics_comparison_heatmap.png - Model performance comparison heatmap
   - scatterplots/ - True vs predicted scatterplots for all feature sets and groups
   - shap/ - SHAP analysis plots for XGBoost models (if available)
6. nutpred.log - Detailed execution log

